       >>SOURCE FORMAT IS FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. p0.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-NUMERIC                     PIC 9(2)       VALUE 45.
01  WS-ALPHABETIC                  PIC A(6)       VALUE 'ABCDEF'.
01  WS-GROUP.
    05  WS-MSG                     PIC  X(70).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "PROGRAM P0"

    DISPLAY WS-NUMERIC
    DISPLAY WS-ALPHABETIC
    DISPLAY WS-MSG

    MOVE 'Program "P1" was called by "P0"' TO WS-MSG
    CALL 'p1' USING BY REFERENCE WS-GROUP END-CALL

    DISPLAY 'BACK TO "P0", received the message:'
    DISPLAY WS-NUMERIC
    DISPLAY WS-ALPHABETIC
    DISPLAY WS-MSG

    STOP RUN.
